[options]
[A.]
                         <h2>RUN FOR YOUR LIFE!  <a href="#mission3">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
                ~[Ipriest.56]             ~[IrainAviary.10]
<br>                                                             ~1~y<?!{sw_difficulty1}>HARD</?><?{sw_difficulty1}>EASY</?>~.
<br>
<i>After you escaped the clutches of Hades you made a wild dash onto a mysterious island.</i>
<p>
You ended up in behind the lines of the enemy.<br>
Which ones are the true enemies?<br>
Only time will tell.<i>
<p>In order to survive this mess you must find and capture the one priest that holds the key to your safe passage.<br>

<p>
          <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55"> ~[IfortGump.50] </a>                            <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">~[IfortGump.22] </a>                     <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">~[Ipriest.13]</a><br>
<a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55">Review Knowledge</a>      <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">    Let's Do It!   </a>      <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">Leave HELL</a>
<$PlaySound,priestFree.wav>
$OnExit= ,PlaySound,priestMove1.wav
$Button= ,Tell,A.


[ai6PriestCaptured][ai4PriestCaptured][ai3PriestCaptured][ai2PriestCaptured]
<h2>You receive a message from the {sw_god5}.</h2><br>
<i>You think you're pretty smart.<br>
Well, he is not the prisoner.  Ha-Ha!</i>
$Button=Let's capture another,DoNothing,0


[ai5PriestCaptured]
<$Config,sw_m3=0>
<$Config,sw_m6=1>

    <h2>The {sw_god2} speaks:</h2><br>

<i>"Thank you for saving me."
<p>
"I was entrapped by the {sw_god5}<i>."
<p>
Now I can transform back to myself.</i><br><br>
                            ~[Ianim.10]<br>
In a puff of smoke The Wind Fury appears!
<p>
~I"Oh my God"~., you think to yourself, ~I"I've just rescued the Wind Fury.~.
<p>
<i>"Now"</i>, says the Wind Fury, <i>"we must go....."</i>
$Button=Let's go!,MissionBegin,sw_m6
$Timeout=5,Tell,next1

[next1]
    <h2>The {sw_god2} speaks:</h2><br>

<i>"Thank you for saving me."
<p>
"I was entrapped by the {sw_god5}<i>."
<p>
Now I can transform back to myself.</i><br>
                    ~[Imog.16]<br>

In a puff of smoke The Wind Fury appears!
<p>
~I"Oh my God"~., you think to yourself, ~I"I've just rescued the Wind Fury.~.
<p>
<i>"Now"</i>, says the Wind Fury, <i>"we must go....."</i>
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=0>
<$Config,sw_mvar0=9000>
<$Config,sw_mvar1=2000>
<$Config,sw_mvar2=1>
<$Config,sw_mvar3=3000>
$Button=Let's go!,MissionBegin,sw_m6



[Failed]
<?{sw_difficulty1}>
You have just been thrown back down into {sw_hades}.
You will surely perish now.
<$Config,sw_m3=0>
<$Config,sw_m1=1>
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=0>
<$Config,sw_mvar0=0>
<$Config,sw_mvar1=15000>
<$Config,sw_mvar2=1>
$Button=MissionBegin,sw_m1
</?>
<?!{sw_difficulty1}>
Hurry! Before {sw_hades} gets his wits together, and decides to torment you
 in hell! You have one more chance, then you'll be thrown back in hades to fight
  for your freedom, again!
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=1>
<$Config,sw_mvar0=12000>
<$Config,sw_mvar1=1000>
<$Config,sw_mvar2=6>
